* PRODSCHED - PRODUCTION SCHEDULE MAINTENANCE (MANTIS/SUPRA)
* New (2026-09) manufacturing scenario: schedules a production line and
* date against an order ORDENQ has already confirmed, via ORDENQ's own
* SCHEDULE_PRODUCTION entry point -- the two programs' call graphs and
* the STEELDB schema's ORDERMST/PRODSCHED linkpath connect through this.
PROGRAM "PRODSCHED"
TEXT ORDER_NO(10)
TEXT LINE_ID(4)
NUMERIC SCHED_DATE(6)
TEXT SCHED_STATUS(4)
TEXT MSG(60)
VIEW SCHEDVIEW OF PRODSCHED
ENTRY MAIN(ORDER_NO, LINE_ID, SCHED_DATE)
  SCHED_STATUS = "PLND"
  ADD-M(SCHEDVIEW)
  IF STATUS <> 0
    MSG = "Schedule could not be added"
  END
  ENDTR
EXIT
